        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashdod",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Industrialist Israel Rogosin opened his main Israeli factory in Ashdod on August 9, 1960, sparking the city’s industrial growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
