      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ashdod sits on the historic Via Maris, an ancient trade route linking Egypt to the Levant.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashdod",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The passenger railway to Ashdod opened in 1992 after renovating the historic line to Egypt.",
